3. Mục tiêu: I want to upload my files to Google Driv | Bước trước: Click on the New icon on the screen. | Bước kế: Click on the Upload option on the screen.
4. Mục tiêu: I want to search for my Mount Rushmore file in OneDriv | Bước trước: Click on the next icon on the bottom right corner of the screen. | Bước kế: Click on the next icon on the bottom right corner of the screen.
